## 🛠️ Setup

### 1. Install dependencies and dev tools

This project uses uv for dependency and tooling management.
Use this command mainly for local dev tools (ruff, mypy, pre-commit, alembic, etc.).

```bash
uv sync
```

### 2. Run the local stack (API + PostgreSQL)

```bash
docker compose up
```

### 3. Quality checks (app only)

```bash
uv run ruff check app
uv run ruff format app
uv run mypy app
```

### 4. Database migrations workflow

Create a new revision from model changes:

```bash
make autogenerate m="your_migration_message"
```

Create a manual revision:

```bash
make revision m="your_manual_message"
```

Apply pending migrations:

```bash
make migrate
```

Show migration history:

```bash
make history
```

Rollback one migration:

```bash
make downgrade
```

{% if add_pre_commit -%}
### 5. Enable pre-commit hooks

```bash
uv run pre-commit install
```

{% endif -%}
## 🧭 Workflow Schema

```text
Edit app code
  -> Run checks (ruff/mypy on app)
  -> Update SQLAlchemy models if needed
  -> Generate migration (make autogenerate)
  -> Review migration file
  -> Apply migration (make migrate)
  -> Start stack (docker compose up)
  -> Test API endpoints
```

